# Vendored multi-tool agent skill mirrors (installed by `npx skills`).
# The canonical location is .claude/skills; the other 17 tool-specific copies
# are near-duplicates (same 7 skills, different SKILL.md per tool convention)
# and are not required by this project. See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, "Development
# tooling: agent skills" for the full rationale.
.agents/
.augment/
.codebuddy/
.codewhale/
.continue/
.cursor/
.factory/
.gemini/
.github/prompts/
.kilocode/
.kiro/
.opencode/
.qoder/
.roo/
.trae/
.warp/
.windsurf/

# Unused skills under .claude/skills. Only ui-ux-pro-max is tracked — its
# dataset is cited as documented provenance for the design direction in
# BRAND-SYSTEM.md. These may exist on disk (available to agents locally) but
# must not be re-added to git. See docs/ARCHITECTURE.md for the rationale.
.claude/skills/banner-design/
.claude/skills/brand/
.claude/skills/design/
.claude/skills/design-system/
.claude/skills/slides/
.claude/skills/ui-styling/

# Source documents (CV, logo). Shipped assets live in public/.
/Attachments
